# Docker does not read .gitignore. Everything below would otherwise be shipped
# in the build context — and `fly deploy` builds on a REMOTE builder, so the
# context leaves this machine even when nothing COPYs it into the image.
#
# Patterns here are anchored to the context root unless they start with `**/`.
# `*.md` would match ./CLAUDE.md but not ./.ipynb_checkpoints/CLAUDE-checkpoint.md;
# every "anywhere" rule below is written with the prefix for that reason.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
# src/.env holds the live OPENAI_API_KEY and LLM_API_KEY. It is gitignored, so
# it never reaches GitHub, but an image is a different distribution channel:
# anyone who pulls it could read /app/.env.
#
# It is also a correctness problem. settings.py calls load_dotenv() at import,
# before it reads DEBUG, and find_dotenv() would walk straight into a baked
# /app/.env. load_dotenv() does not override variables already set, so an
# explicit Fly secret still wins — but any variable NOT set on the host would
# come from the baked file instead of the safe code default, reinstating the
# production-DEBUG failure that was fixed in PR #7.
**/.env
**/.env.*
# A committed example file is documentation, not a secret: keep it available
# so the README can point at it. This exception must stay below the rule it
# undoes — the last matching pattern wins.
!**/.env.example

# --- Local state, not build output -----------------------------------------
# A stale Chroma tree from local runs, and the downloaded PDFs. Neither is the
# real corpus. Note that the Dockerfile does not yet download or index
# anything, so the image currently ships with an empty Chroma and retrieves
# nothing — the ingestion step is a later piece of work.
**/vector_store/
**/comply_sources/

# --- Notes and instructions ------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md names the client. It must not travel in a build context any more
# than it travels in the repository — and neither must the checkpoint copy of
# it that .ipynb_checkpoints/ keeps.
**/*.md
.claude/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.rtk/
working_docs/

# --- Noise -----------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.sqlite3
**/staticfiles/

.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.venv/
venv/

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
